<Legal
  title="Copyright & Takedown Policy"
  description="SharedChats links to conversations, never hosts them. Summaries are our original work. Rights holders can request delisting by email, honored promptly."
  lastUpdated="July 26, 2026"
>
  <h2>We link, we don't host</h2>
  <p>
    SharedChats never stores or reproduces conversation content. Each entry contains only a link to
    the original share page on the AI provider's site, plus metadata we wrote ourselves. If a
    conversation is deleted at the source, nothing of it remains here.
  </p>

  <h2>Our editorial work</h2>
  <p>
    Entry titles, summaries, curator notes, and tags are original editorial work created by
    SharedChats and are © SharedChats. They are descriptions of conversations, not excerpts from
    them.
  </p>

  <h2>Takedown requests</h2>
  <p>
    If you are a rights holder, or the author of a shared conversation, and want an entry delisted,
    email <a href="mailto:hello@sharedchats.com">hello@sharedchats.com</a> with the entry's URL and
    a short note about your connection to the content. We honor valid requests promptly — usually
    within a few days. You do not need a lawyer or a formal notice format.
  </p>

  <h2>Repeat concerns</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe multiple entries affect your rights, one email covering them all is enough. We
    would rather over-remove than argue.
  </p>
</Legal>
